enable_animation=\"true\" link_style=\"default\"]</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shopify migration from WooCommerce<br />\n</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Migration of thousands of art SKUs</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Event management architecture</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Community engagement tools</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Training for internal team</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>[/fancy-ul][split_line_heading animation_type=\"line-reveal-by-space\" font_style=\"h2\" line_reveal_by_space_text_effect=\"none\" content_alignment=\"default\" mobile_content_alignment=\"inherit\" link_target=\"_self\" text_content=\"Impact\" font_size=\"3vw\" text_direction=\"default\"][/split_line_heading][fancy-ul icon_type=\"font_icon\" icon=\"icon-ok\" color=\"Accent-Color\" alignment=\"left\" spacing=\"5px\" enable_animation=\"true\" link_style=\"default\"]</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">100% successful migration of thousands of products</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">+72% increase in online art sales</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br />\n</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3x improvement in event registrations</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Simplified internal operations</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span>[/fancy-ul][nectar_highlighted_text color_type=\"gradient\" highlight_color=\"#b5fff0\" secondary_color=\"#5dff92\" text_color=\"#210e1c\" style=\"full_text\" highlight_expansion=\"default\" text_direction=\"default\"]<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We built a platform that honors culture and scales commerce.</span>[/nectar_highlighted_text][vc_row_inner column_margin=\"default\" column_direction=\"default\" column_direc