h\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_info_section\"},{\"id\":\"1b0e01f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"icon_list\":[{\"text\":\"Increase brand awareness \",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-chart-line\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"_id\":\"3562b04\"},{\"text\":\"Drive traffic to your website\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-laptop\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"_id\":\"33313c3\"},{\"text\":\"Generate consistent new leads\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-id-card\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"},\"_id\":\"0f46581\"},{\"_id\":\"d34614b\",\"text\":\"Make online sales\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-money-bill-alt\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"}}],\"space_between\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"divider\":\"yes\",\"icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_indent\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"icon_typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon-list\"},{\"id\":\"f74b73b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Once you know your goals, you can create targeted strategies to achieve them. There are numerous platforms and outlets in the digital marketing landscape. Knowing clearly what your goals are first, will help you determine where to focus your energy and resources.<\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"fbb8fca\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_inline_size_tablet\":50,\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"64\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"__globals__\":{\"border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8124991\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>For example, one of our clients is a Pilates studio in Dallas,TX. They are a new business, they just had their two year anniversary, and one of their initial goals was to increase brand awareness.\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"355f59e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"We achieved this through a few different tactics:\",\"title_tag\":\"h3\",\"loading_animation\":\"yes\",\"animation_delay\":\"400\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_info_section\"},{\"id\":\"429fa95\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tabs\":[{\"tab_title\":\"Consistent organic social media posts\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>At least 4 feed posts a week and daily stories including resharing user-generated content<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"f4036f1\"},{\"tab_title\":\"Automated sms with invitation to leave a review to everyone that takes a class\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Continually receiving new reviews is a great way to boost your Google Business Listing which helps new people who are looking for Pilates classes near them, find the studio<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"7957c99\"},{\"_id\":\"23e7180\",\"tab_title\":\"Running an always-on Meta ad campaign with a professional video that showcases the Pilates studio, trainers plus member testimonials\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>The ad is run to a broadly defined audience within 5 miles around their studio as wells as to a hyper targeted audience of people similar to their current members<\\/p>\"}],\"title_html_tag\":\"h5\",\"icon_align\":\"right\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"toggle\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"22f90b4\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"100\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Define highlight\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"14d7a859\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"text_align\":\"center\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_title\":\"Column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"34ba798\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"By targeting your marketing efforts, you can maximize your results and achieve your goals more quickly.\",\"text_tag\":\"h3\",\"highlight_position\":\"8,10\",\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":83,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_highlight\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"9810fb3\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Target Pic\",\"_element_id\":\"audience\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fd76915\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"200\",\"right\":\"200\",\"bottom\":\"200\",\"left\":\"200\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/05\\/pexels-isaac-weatherly-3829926-e1683667352833.jpg\",\"id\":5193,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"center center\",\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_size\":\"cover\",\"background_motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling\":\"yes\",\"background_motion_fx_translateY_effect\":\"yes\",\"background_motion_fx_blur_level\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_background\":\"gradient\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c4c2154\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"KNOW YOUR TARGET AUDIENCE\",\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_section_title\"},{\"id\":\"1658825\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Knowing your target audience is the foundation of any successful marketing campaign. By understanding who your target audience is, you can tailor your content and messaging to resonate with them effectively.\\n\",\"text_tag\":\"h3\",\"highlight_position\":\"-1\",\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":83,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_highlight\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f295bbe\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"structure\":\"20\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Target Audience\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e4f3ff8\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_inline_size_tablet\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5443afd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Here are a few tips for getting to know your target audience:\",\"title_tag\":\"h3\",\"line_break_positions\":\"4\",\"loading_animation\":\"yes\",\"animation_delay\":\"400\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_info_section\"},{\"id\":\"6737b78\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"icon_list\":[{\"text\":\"Demographics: This includes information such as age, gender, location, or income.\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-chart-pie\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"_id\":\"3562b04\"},{\"text\":\"Interests: What are your target audience\'s hobbies, interests, and passions?\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-thumbs-up\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"_id\":\"33313c3\"},{\"text\":\"Behaviors: How do they spend their time? What are their online habits?\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-user\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"_id\":\"0f46581\"},{\"_id\":\"d34614b\",\"text\":\"Pain points: What are their challenges and frustrations?\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-list-alt\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"}}],\"space_between\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"divider\":\"yes\",\"divider_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_indent\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"icon_typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon-list\"},{\"id\":\"418033e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/01\\/Step-2-Custom-Audience.png\",\"id\":5033,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_image_with_text\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"ef318b3\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_inline_size_tablet\":50,\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"64\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"__globals__\":{\"border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b2987db\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"For example, with the Pilates studio, we broke down their target audience as follows:\",\"title_tag\":\"h3\",\"loading_animation\":\"yes\",\"animation_delay\":\"400\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_info_section\"},{\"id\":\"c78f696\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>For the evergreen video campaign, we targeted women aged 20 - 55 within 5 miles of their studio. As well as, created a Lookalike (LAL) audience based on their current member list.<\\/p><p><br \\/>We could have narrowed our targeting by looking for women with an interest in fitness or who liked certain fitness apparel brands, or women who liked other Pilates studios and showed interest in a healthy lifestyle. But we chose to keep our audience broad since our campaign goal was Brand Awareness.<\\/p><p><br \\/>Keeping your target audience in mind is also important when choosing the copy &amp; tone in your ad messaging. As well as making sure the images and video resonate with them.<\\/p><p><br \\/>By using video in the ad campaign, we were then able to generate a new interest-based audience. Meta keeps a record of anyone that views the video for 3 seconds, 10 seconds up to those that watched the entire video. Along with all users who click on links or engage with the ad. So we created a new ad with more incentive to an audience that showed initial interest in the studio by engaging with the ad in some form. <\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"8960a45\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"100\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Target highlight\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"217a5f5\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"text_align\":\"center\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_title\":\"Column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9207ba7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"The more you know about your target audience, the better you can tailor your marketing efforts to reach them. So take the time to get to know them well, and you\'ll be well on your way to success.\",\"text_tag\":\"h3\",\"highlight_position\":\"9,19\",\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":83,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_highlight\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"2312539\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Branding Pic\",\"_element_id\":\"branding\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d5f58cd\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"200\",\"right\":\"200\",\"bottom\":\"200\",\"left\":\"200\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/05\\/pexels-alexis-caso-3094799-e1683666296280.jpg\",\"id\":5187,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"center center\",\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_size\":\"cover\",\"background_motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling\":\"yes\",\"background_motion_fx_translateY_effect\":\"yes\",\"background_motion_fx_blur_level\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_background\":\"gradient\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0a2ac9f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"CONSISTENT BRANDING\",\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_section_title\"},{\"id\":\"d49f121\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Consistent branding is important for creating a cohesive and recognizable brand identity across all social media platforms. By using the same colors, fonts, and imagery on all of your social media accounts, you can create a strong visual presence that will help people remember your brand. \",\"text_tag\":\"h3\",\"highlight_position\":\"-1\",\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":83,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_highlight\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"19456e2\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"structure\":\"20\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Branding\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a0178a3\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_inline_size_tablet\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"11d6f06\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Additionally, consistent branding can help you build trust and credibility with your audience. When people see the same logo, colors, and fonts on all of your social media accounts, they will know that they are interacting with a legitimate and trustworthy brand.<\\/p><p><br \\/>This seems like common sense, but we often see brands who struggle with this cohesiveness when posting organic social content. Now, the days of posting all matching Canva templates on your social accounts has faded. But you don\\u2019t want to use completely different colors and fonts and styles because it will take away from your recognizability. <\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"5d0c42a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Currently, personalized content that shows real humans doing real things, is what connects businesses with their customers best. And keeping a similar look and feel to your personalized content is key. \",\"text_tag\":\"h3\",\"highlight_position\":\"-1\",\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":83,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_highlight\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"2e3395c\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_inline_size_tablet\":50,\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"64\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"__globals__\":{\"border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3be01f4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"For example, with the Pilates studio, we rotate between a few different Canva templates\",\"title_tag\":\"h3\",\"loading_animation\":\"yes\",\"animation_delay\":\"400\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_info_section\"},{\"id\":\"b4cd6d4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>using the brand\\u2019s 3 colors and 2 fonts. We use these templates to showcase motivational quotes, announcements, events, and customer reviews. Creating a Brand Template in Canva is an easy way to stay consistent.<\\/p><p><br \\/>We primarily post photos and videos that are personalized to the studio. We use a similar technique and style each time we post these. Plus, we maintain the brand\'s voice when writing captions.<\\/p><p><br \\/>By following these tips, you can create a strong and consistent brand identity that will help you connect with your audience and build trust.<\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"86b41bc\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"100\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Branding Highlight\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"032ff15\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"text_align\":\"center\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_title\":\"Column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3373e61\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"images\":[{\"id\":5431,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/07\\/1.png\"},{\"id\":5432,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/07\\/4.png\"},{\"id\":5433,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/07\\/8.png\"},{\"id\":5434,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/07\\/42.png\"}],\"columns\":\"4\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"qi_addons_for_element