loyal team and membership, reflecting the diversity and spirit of Oak Cliff.\",\"text_tag\":\"h3\",\"highlight_position\":\"-1\",\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":83,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_highlight\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"0789ee2\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Challenges\",\"_element_id\":\"challenges\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ff682dd\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"100\",\"right\":\"200\",\"bottom\":\"100\",\"left\":\"200\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"center center\",\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_size\":\"cover\",\"background_motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling\":\"yes\",\"background_motion_fx_translateY_effect\":\"yes\",\"background_motion_fx_blur_level\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_background\":\"gradient\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6729893\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Challenges\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"\"},\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_section_title\"},{\"id\":\"0150c93\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Despite lesser competition in the Pilates niche within Dallas, the high cost of Pilates posed a barrier to entry. OCP aimed to break this barrier by offering affordable, inclusive fitness solutions.\",\"text_tag\":\"h3\",\"highlight_position\":\"20\",\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":83,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_highlight\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"e8809e5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Objectives\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"100\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"100\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_id\":\"objectives\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9c2d32c\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"200\",\"right\":\"200\",\"bottom\":\"200\",\"left\":\"200\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/05\\/OCP-website-header2.jpeg\",\"id\":5567,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"center center\",\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_size\":\"cover\",\"background_motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling\":\"yes\",\"background_motion_fx_translateY_effect\":\"yes\",\"background_motion_fx_blur_level\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_background\":\"gradient\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"876d73e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Objectives\",\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"\"},\"_title\":\"Section Title\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_section_title\"},{\"id\":\"537ca29\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"With an ambitious goal to expand into new markets without sacrificing their core values or service quality, OCP needed effective strategies to promote the benefits of Pilates and inclusivity of their studio.\",\"text_tag\":\"h3\",\"highlight_position\":\"-1\",\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":83,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_highlight\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"8960a45\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":true},\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Solutions\",\"_element_id\":\"solutions\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"217a5f5\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"text_align\":\"center\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_title\":\"Column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9207ba7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"To propel Oak Cliff Pilates into a prominent community fitness leader and expand their membership significantly, we implemented a multi-faceted digital marketing strategy. This comprehensive approach encompassed enhancing local SEO, leveraging a dynamic social and email marketing strategy, actively engaging with the community, and deploying efficient digital advertising.\\u00a0\",\"text_tag\":\"h3\",\"highlight_position\":\"20,23\",\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":83,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_highlight\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3b20fef\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"structure\":\"20\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":true},\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"SEO\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3a4d051\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_inline_size_tablet\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"93d9e86\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Boosting Local Discoverability\",\"title_tag\":\"h3\",\"loading_animation\":\"yes\",\"animation_delay\":\"400\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_info_section\"},{\"id\":\"69609e7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>To solidify OCP\'s local presence, we focused on optimizing their Google Business Listing and ensuring widespread visibility across various directories. By accumulating over 400 positive reviews, we enhanced their online reputation, which in turn significantly boosted their SEO rankings. A robust reputation management system was implemented to systematically gather feedback and encourage content sharing, further enriching their website and online presence.<\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"d94a5ac\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Learn More\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"fbb8fca\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_inline_size_tablet\":50,\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"64\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"__globals__\":{\"border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"896f3a3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/05\\/gbl-ocp.png\",\"id\":5637,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"image_box_shadow_box_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":10,\"vertical\":10,\"blur\":0,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1595ca7\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"structure\":\"20\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":true},\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Social\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d7c5d7a\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_inline_size_tablet\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"84ce5e2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/07\\/4.png\",\"id\":5432,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"41d050e\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_inline_size_tablet\":50,\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"64\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"__globals__\":{\"border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"},\"content_position\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6cd3775\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Engaging and Expanding the Community\",\"title_tag\":\"h3\",\"loading_animation\":\"yes\",\"animation_delay\":\"400\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_info_section\"},{\"id\":\"5c9301c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Our approach to social media and email marketing involved creating high-quality, branded content including professional photos and videos, which resonated deeply with the community. By maintaining active engagement with followers and implementing strategic email marketing techniques such as drip campaigns and automation, we successfully expanded OCP\'s email database to 10,000 subscribers and grew their social media following to over 5,000. This grassroots organic growth was instrumental in fostering a strong, loyal community around the OCP brand.<\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"01b36c3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Learn More\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1c16523\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"structure\":\"20\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":true},\"qodef_offset_top\":\"50%\",\"qodef_offset_left\":\"50%\",\"qodef_enable_grid_row\":\"grid\",\"_title\":\"Community\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"87677f4\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_inline_size_tablet\":100,\"content_position\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6ac7a5e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Building Connections and Visibility\",\"title_tag\":\"h3\",\"loading_animation\":\"yes\",\"animation_delay\":\"400\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"boldlab_core_info_section\"},{\"id\":\"80c9f2d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>OCP\'s integration into the local scene was aggressively pursued through strategic partnerships with other businesses, participation in community events, and consistent listings in local publications and directories. These efforts were complemented by professional content creation at events, capturing the essence of community involvement and using this content to fuel further marketing initiatives. This not only enhanced OCP\'s community profile but also established strong local business alliances.<\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"c0a0c05\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Learn More\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1df954b\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_inline_size_tablet\":50,\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"64\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"__globals__\":{\"border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e37b44e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"children\":[{\"_id\":\"4d838bb\",\"images\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/05\\/S7304891.jpeg\",\"id\":5641,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},{\"_id\":\"0fec342\",\"images\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/05\\/S7304842.jpeg\",\"id\":5640,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},{\"_id\":\"4c374e5\",\"images\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/05\\/S7304827.jpeg\",\"id\":5639,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},{\"_id\":\"1707f24\",\"images\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/05\\/S7304822.jpeg\",\"id\":5633,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"librar