-2','','','2023-05-11 14:48:11','2023-05-11 14:48:11','',5148,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5202,1,'2023-05-11 14:48:17','2023-05-11 14:48:17','','7','','inherit','open','closed','','7-2','','','2023-05-11 14:48:17','2023-05-11 14:48:17','',5148,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/7.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5203,1,'2023-05-11 14:48:24','2023-05-11 14:48:24','','6','','inherit','open','closed','','6-2','','','2023-05-11 14:48:24','2023-05-11 14:48:24','',5148,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/6.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5204,1,'2023-05-11 14:48:32','2023-05-11 14:48:32','','5','','inherit','open','closed','','5-2','','','2023-05-11 14:48:32','2023-05-11 14:48:32','',5148,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5205,1,'2023-05-11 14:48:39','2023-05-11 14:48:39','','4','','inherit','open','closed','','4-2','','','2023-05-11 14:48:39','2023-05-11 14:48:39','',5148,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5206,1,'2023-05-11 14:48:45','2023-05-11 14:48:45','','3','','inherit','open','closed','','3-2','','','2023-05-11 14:48:45','2023-05-11 14:48:45','',5148,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/3.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5207,1,'2023-05-11 14:48:51','2023-05-11 14:48:51','','2','','inherit','open','closed','','2-2','','','2023-05-11 14:48:51','2023-05-11 14:48:51','',5148,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5208,1,'2023-05-11 14:48:57','2023-05-11 14:48:57','','1','','inherit','open','closed','','1-2','','','2023-05-11 14:48:57','2023-05-11 14:48:57','',5148,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5210,1,'2023-06-30 16:38:01','2023-06-30 16:38:01','','Blog','','publish','closed','closed','','blog','','','2023-06-30 16:38:01','2023-06-30 16:38:01','',0,'https://kijacreative.com/?page_id=5210',0,'page','',0),(5431,1,'2023-07-19 21:54:48','2023-07-19 21:54:48','','1','','inherit','open','closed','','1-3','','','2023-07-19 21:54:48','2023-07-19 21:54:48','',837,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5432,1,'2023-07-19 21:54:54','2023-07-19 21:54:54','','4','','inherit','open','closed','','4-3','','','2023-07-19 21:54:54','2023-07-19 21:54:54','',837,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5433,1,'2023-07-19 21:55:00','2023-07-19 21:55:00','','8','','inherit','open','closed','','8-3','','','2023-07-19 21:55:00','2023-07-19 21:55:00','',837,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/8.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5434,1,'2023-07-19 21:55:05','2023-07-19 21:55:05','','42','','inherit','open','closed','','42','','','2023-07-19 21:55:05','2023-07-19 21:55:05','',837,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/42.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5453,1,'2024-04-23 17:23:47','2024-04-23 17:23:47','<h3 >\n			Grow your community presence and expand your digital reach	</h3>		\n		<h1 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n					Lunch &amp; Learn			</h1>\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;color: #FFFFFF\">Hosted by Kija Creative</p>\n			<h4 >\n			We\'ve discovered that simply running ads on social media isn\'t enough to consistently attract new customers, especially with the increasing competition from new businesses in our growing neighborhood. Your voice can easily get lost in the mix if you don’t have the right pieces in place. At this  event, we\'ll discuss what actually is effective marketing for local businesses, and then we\'ll be happy to answer any questions you may have.\n	</h4>		\n			<h3 >\n			DATE:  Tuesday, May 7th<br>\nTIME: 12pm - 2pm<br>\nLOCATION: Cenzo\'s<br>\nCOST: Free	</h3>		\n		<p>Bring your business card for some networking plus a drawing for a $50 gift card!<br></p>		\n			<iframe\n  src=\"https://link.kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/widget/form/B36uEVtcM1mUOprIRuXT\"\n  style=\"width:100%;height:100%;border:none;border-radius:0px\"\n  id=\"inline-B36uEVtcM1mUOprIRuXT\" \n  data-layout=\"{\'id\':\'INLINE\'}\"\n  data-trigger-type=\"alwaysShow\"\n  data-trigger-value=\"\"\n  data-activation-type=\"alwaysActivated\"\n  data-activation-value=\"\"\n  data-deactivation-type=\"neverDeactivate\"\n  data-deactivation-value=\"\"\n  data-form-name=\"Lunch & Learn\"\n  data-height=\"826\"\n  data-layout-iframe-id=\"inline-B36uEVtcM1mUOprIRuXT\"\n  data-form-id=\"B36uEVtcM1mUOprIRuXT\"\n  title=\"Lunch & Learn\"\n      >\n</iframe>\n	<img width=\"949\" height=\"610\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph.jpg 949w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph-300x193.jpg 300w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph-768x494.jpg 768w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph-600x386.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 949px) 100vw, 949px\" />		<a itemprop=\"url\" style=\"font-size: 80px\" href=\"https://vimeo.com/938393069\" data-type=\"iframe\">\n	</a>\n			<h2 >\n			Who We Are	</h2>		\n		<p>We specialize in combining community engagement and digital marketing. We teach best practices for online success, create digital assets, teach social media strategy &amp; co-plan local events, all to help amplify your voice in the community and online. We are purposely a boutique agency in order to focus on personalized service and ensure your business gets the attention it deserves. </p>		\n			<h3 >\n			What our clients say	</h3>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.9.1 - 14-12-2022 */\n.elementor-testimonial-wrapper{overflow:hidden;text-align:center}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-content{font-size:1.3em;margin-bottom:20px}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-name{line-height:1.5;display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-job{font-size:.85em;display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta{width:100%;line-height:1}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta-inner{display:inline-block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-details,.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-image{display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-image img{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;-o-object-fit:cover;object-fit:cover;max-width:none}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-aside .elementor-testimonial-image{padding-right:15px}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-aside .elementor-testimonial-details{text-align:left}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-details,.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-image{display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-image{margin-bottom:20px}</style>		\n\"Partnering with Kija Creative was the best decision we made this year! Their team doesn\'t just understand digital marketing; they breathe life into it with a mix of creativity and precision that\'s hard to come by Our community presence has never been stronger, and it\'s all thanks to the magic touch of Kija Creative!\"\n							<img width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/amanda.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />						\n														Amanda\n																						Owner at Oak Cliff Pilates','Landing Page - Lunch & Learn','','draft','closed','closed','','lunch-and-learn','','','2026-02-24 22:21:06','2026-02-24 22:21:06','',0,'https://kijacreative.com/?page_id=5453',0,'page','',0),(5469,1,'2024-04-23 18:24:15','2024-04-23 18:24:15','','amanda','','inherit','open','closed','','amanda','','','2024-04-23 18:24:15','2024-04-23 18:24:15','',5453,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/amanda.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(5479,1,'2024-04-23 18:33:43','2024-04-23 18:33:43','','kiel-steph','','inherit','open','closed','','kiel-steph','','','2024-04-23 18:33:43','2024-04-23 18:33:43','',5453,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(5529,1,'2024-04-23 20:22:03','2024-04-23 20:22:03','','kija-background','','inherit','open','closed','','kija-background','','','2024-04-23 20:22:03','2024-04-23 20:22:03','',5453,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kija-background.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5539,1,'2024-04-24 17:18:30','2024-04-24 17:18:30','','Tristan','','inherit','open','closed','','tristan','','','2024-04-24 17:18:30','2024-04-24 17:18:30','',0,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Tristan.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5550,1,'2024-05-13 19:31:52','2024-05-13 19:31:52','<h3 >\n			Oak Cliff Pilates (OCP), a neighborhood family-owned business since 2021, has transformed the fitness and Pilates landscape in their community. Managed by Amanda Mecsey, a ten-year Pilates veteran, OCP set out to differentiate itself from conventional studios by making Pilates accessible and appealing to a broader demographic. Their success is evident in their expansion from 30 to 95 weekly classes and growth from 250 to over 500 members.	</h3>		\n			<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/widget-icon-list.min.css\">		<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"/#client\">\n										Client Background\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/#challenges\">\n										Challenges\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/#objectives\">\n										Objectives\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/#solutions\">\n										Solutions\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"/#results\">\n										Results\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n					Client Background			</h2>\n			<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n			OCP operates under the skilled guidance of Amanda Mecsey. Her leadership and passion for Pilates have cultivated a loyal team and membership, reflecting the diversity and spirit of Oak Cliff.	</h3>		\n		<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n					Challenges			</h2>\n			<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n			Despite lesser competition in the Pilates niche within Dallas, the high cost of Pilates posed a barrier to entry. OCP aimed to break this barrier by offering affordable, inclusive fitness solutions.	</h3>		\n		<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n					Objectives			</h2>\n			<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n			With an ambitious goal to expand into new markets without sacrificing their core values or service quality, OCP needed effective strategies to promote the benefits of Pilates and inclusivity of their studio.	</h3>		\n			<h3 >\n			To propel Oak Cliff Pilates into a prominent community fitness leader and expand their membership significantly, we implemented a multi-faceted digital marketing strategy. This comprehensive approach encompassed enhancing local SEO, leveraging a dynamic social and email marketing strategy, actively engaging with the community, and deploying efficient digital advertising. 	</h3>		\n			<h3 >\n		Boosting Local Discoverability	</h3>\n		<p>To solidify OCP\'s local presence, we focused on optimizing their Google Business Listing and ensuring widespread visibility across various directories. By accumulating over 400 positive reviews, we enhanced their online reputation, which in turn significantly boosted their SEO rankings. A robust reputation management system was implemented to systematically gather feedback and encourage content sharing, further enriching their website and online presence.</p>		\n			<a href=\"/\" role=\"button\">\n						Learn More\n					</a>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.9.1 - 14-12-2022 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"1024\" height=\"734\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/gbl-ocp-1024x734.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/gbl-ocp-1024x734.png 1024w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/gbl-ocp-300x215.png 300w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/gbl-ocp-768x551.png 768w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/gbl-ocp-1536x1102.png 1536w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/gbl-ocp-600x430.png 600w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/gbl-ocp.png 1980w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />															\n															<img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-300x300.png 300w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-150x150.png 150w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-768x768.png 768w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-650x650.png 650w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-600x600.png 600w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-100x100.png 100w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />															\n			<h3 >\n		Engaging and Expanding the Community	</h3>\n		<p>Our approach to social media and email marketing involved creating high-quality, branded content including professional photos and videos, which resonated deeply with the community. By maintaining active engagement with followers and implementing strategic email marketing techniques such as drip campaigns and automation, we successfully expanded OCP\'s email database to 10,000 subscribers and grew their social media following to over 5,000. This grassroots organic growth was instrumental in fostering a strong, loyal community around the OCP brand.</p>		\n			<a href=\"/\" role=\"button\">\n						Learn More\n					</a>\n			<h3 >\n		Building Connections and Visibility	</h3>\n		<p>OCP\'s integration into the local scene was aggressively pursued through strategic partnerships with other businesses, participation in community events, and consistent listings in local publications and directories. These efforts were complemented by professional content creation at events, capturing the essence of community involvement and using this content to fuel further marketing initiatives. This not only enhanced OCP\'s community profile but also established strong local business alliances.</p>		\n			<a href=\"/\" role=\"button\">\n						Learn More\n					</a>\n					<img width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304891.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304891.jpeg 2048w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304891-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304891-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304891-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304891-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304891-600x400.jpeg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" />			\n					<img width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304842.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304842.jpeg 2048w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304842-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304842-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304842-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304842-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304842-600x400.jpeg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" />			\n					<img width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304827.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304827.jpeg 2048w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304827-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304827-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304827-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304827-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304827-600x400.jpeg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" />			\n					<img width=\"2048\" height=\"1365\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304822.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304822.jpeg 2048w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304822-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304822-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304822-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304822-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304822-600x400.jpeg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" />			\n															<img width=\"818\" height=\"556\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Oak-Cliff-Pilates.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Oak-Cliff-Pilates.png 818w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Oak-Cliff-Pilates-300x204.png 300w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Oak-Cliff-Pilates-768x522.png 768w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Oak-Cliff-Pilates-600x408.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 818px) 100vw, 818px\" />															\n			<h3 >\n		Maximizing Impact with Minimal Spend	</h3>\n		<p>To drive direct conversions and bolster brand awareness, we deployed a targeted digital marketing campaign centered around an \'always-on\' evergreen video ad. This campaign generated over 1 million impressions and 6,000 clicks, translating to an impressive $150,000 in revenue from an ad spend of less than $6,000. The high ROI from these ads demonstrates the effectiveness of our tailored, strategic approach to digital advertising.</p>		\n			<a href=\"/\" role=\"button\">\n						Learn More\n					</a>\n			<h3 >\n			These strategic solutions collectively facilitated OCP\'s transition from a local startup to a thriving, community-focused studio with substantial digital engagement and a robust member base. 	</h3>		\n		<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n					Results			</h2>\n			<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n			From 2021 to 2024, OCP\'s revenue soared from $15k to nearly $100k per month, with the team expanding significantly to meet demand. The successful strategy led to the opening of a second studio, catering to professional athletes and private clients.	</h3>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.9.1 - 14-12-2022 */\n.elementor-testimonial-wrapper{overflow:hidden;text-align:center}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-content{font-size:1.3em;margin-bottom:20px}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-name{line-height:1.5;display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-job{font-size:.85em;display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta{width:100%;line-height:1}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta-inner{display:inline-block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-details,.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-image{display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-image img{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;-o-object-fit:cover;object-fit:cover;max-width:none}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-aside .elementor-testimonial-image{padding-right:15px}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-aside .elementor-testimonial-details{text-align:left}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-details,.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-image{display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-image{margin-bottom:20px}</style>		\n							\"Partnering with Kija Creative was the best decision we made! Their team doesn\'t just understand digital marketing; they breathe life into it with a mix of creativity and precision that\'s hard to come by Our community presence has never been stronger, and it\'s all thanks to the magic touch of Kija Creative!\"\n							<img width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/amanda.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />						\n														Amanda Mecsey\n																						Owner\n			<h4>Interested in similar growth for your business? Contact us to learn how our strategies can be tailored to your needs, whether through consultancy or direct collaboration.</h4>\n		<a href=\"https://go.kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/book-with-me-page\" target=\"_self\" data-hover-color=\"#000000\" data-hover-background-color=\"#FFFFFF\" data-hover-border-color=\"#000000\" rel=\"noopener\">	Book a Call</a>','Oak Cliff Pilates Case Study: A Digital Marketing Success Story','','draft','closed','closed','','ocp-case-study','','','2026-02-24 22:21:06','2026-02-24 22:21:06','',0,'https://kijacreative.com/?page_id=5550',0,'page','',0),(5551,1,'2024-05-13 19:15:56','2024-05-13 19:15:56','','OCP-outside-scaled','','inherit','open','closed','','ocp-outside-scaled','','','2024-05-13 19:15:56','2024-05-13 19:15:56','',5550,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/OCP-outside-scaled-1.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(5561,1,'2024-05-13 19:21:12','2024-05-13 19:21:12','','OCP-Website-Header3','','inherit','open','closed','','ocp-website-header3','','','2024-05-13 19:21:12','2024-05-13 19:21:12','',5550,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/OCP-Website-Header3.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(5562,1,'2024-05-13 19:32:11','2024-05-13 19:32:11','','OCP-App2','','inherit','open','closed','','ocp-app2','','','2024-05-13 19:32:11','2024-05-13 19:32:11','',5550,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/OCP-App2.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(5567,1,'2024-05-13 19:34:06','2024-05-13 19:34:06','','OCP-website-header2','','inherit','open','closed','','ocp-website-header2','','','2024-05-13 19:34:06','2024-05-13 19:34:06','',5550,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/OCP-website-header2.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(5568,1,'2024-05-14 18:01:30','2024-05-14 18:01:30','<h3 >\n			Local, social, &amp; community components are integral<br> to effective digital advertising. 	</h3>		\n		<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n					Local			</h2>\n			<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n			Your Google Business Profile isn\'t just a listing; it\'s your digital storefront.	</h3>		\n			<h3 >\n		What is Local SEO?<br />	</h3>\n			<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/widget-icon-list.min.css\">		<ul>\n							<li>\n										Google Business Listing Management\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Reputation Managment \n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Link Building\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Monitoring & Optimizing\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		<p>Local SEO, or Local Search Engine Optimization, is a digital marketing strategy that helps your business appear more prominently in local search results. When people in your area search for services or products you offer, local SEO ensures they find your business first.</p><p>This is a powerful tool that can help your business grow by making sure local customers can easily find you. It’s about being visible, trusted, and chosen by people who need what you offer.</p>		\n			<h3 >\n		Why is Local SEO Important?	</h3>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.9.1 - 14-12-2022 */\n.elementor-toggle{text-align:left}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title{font-weight:700;line-height:1;margin:0;padding:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #d4d4d4;cursor:pointer;outline:none}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title .elementor-toggle-icon{display:inline-block;width:1em}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title .elementor-toggle-icon svg{-webkit-margin-start:-5px;margin-inline-start:-5px;width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title .elementor-toggle-icon.elementor-toggle-icon-right{float:right;text-align:right}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title .elementor-toggle-icon.elementor-toggle-icon-left{float:left;text-align:left}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title .elementor-toggle-icon .elementor-toggle-icon-closed{display:block}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title .elementor-toggle-icon .elementor-toggle-icon-opened{display:none}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title.elementor-active{border-bottom:none}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title.elementor-active .elementor-toggle-icon-closed{display:none}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title.elementor-active .elementor-toggle-icon-opened{display:block}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-content{padding:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #d4d4d4;display:none}@media (max-width:767px){.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-title{padding:12px}.elementor-toggle .elementor-tab-content{padding:12px 10px}}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-toggle,.e-con>.elementor-widget-toggle{width:var(--container-widget-width);--flex-grow:var(--container-widget-flex-grow)}</style>		\n					<h5 id=\"elementor-tab-title-6981\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6981\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n												<a href=\"/\">Increased Visibility</a>\n					</h5>\n					<p>Local SEO helps your business show up in local search results on Google. This means more people in your area will see your business when they search for relevant keywords, leading to more foot traffic and inquiries.</p>\n					<h5 id=\"elementor-tab-title-6982\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6982\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n												<a href=\"/\">Stay Ahead of Competitors</a>\n					</h5>\n					<p>By optimizing your local SEO, you can outrank competitors in search results. This gives you a competitive edge and ensures potential customers choose your business over others.</p>\n					<h5 id=\"elementor-tab-title-6983\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6983\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n												<a href=\"/\">Build Trust and Authority</a>\n					</h5>\n					<p>Effective local SEO involves strategies like local link building and gathering positive reviews. These elements show Google and potential customers that your business is trustworthy and reliable, enhancing your brand&#8217;s reputation.</p>\n					<h5 id=\"elementor-tab-title-6984\" data-tab=\"4\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6984\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n												<a href=\"/\">Cost-Effective Advertising</a>\n					</h5>\n					<p>When your business ranks high in local search results, you can save money on advertising. Appearing at the top of search results organically means you’ll spend less on paid ads while still attracting customers.</p>\n			<h3 >\n			Start optimizing your local presence today and watch your business thrive!	</h3>		\n		<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n					Social			</h2>\n			<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n			Engage with your audience through consistent, personalized content.	</h3>		\n			<h3 >\n		Stay relevant on social media:	</h3>\n		<ul><li>Develop a comprehensive organic social content strategy tailored to your business, including selecting the right platforms and content types.</li><li>Assign a dedicated point person to oversee content creation and engagement with the audience.</li><li>Utilize a mix of professional and personal content, such as branded graphics and videos, to showcase your brand\'s personality.</li><li>Implement a consistent email outreach strategy to engage with current customers and nurture leads.</li></ul>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.9.1 - 14-12-2022 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h3>Through strategic content creation and consistent interaction, local businesses can build strong relationships with customers</h3>		\n		<p>Social media plays a pivotal role in the success of local businesses by providing a powerful platform to connect and engage with the community. It serves as a digital storefront, allowing businesses to showcase their products, services, and brand personality to a wide audience. </p><p>Social media also offers valuable insights into customer preferences and trends, enabling businesses to tailor their offerings and marketing strategies accordingly. Moreover, it provides a cost-effective way to advertise promotions, events, and special offers, driving foot traffic and sales. Overall, social media empowers local businesses to establish a strong online presence, expand their reach, and thrive in an increasingly competitive market landscape.</p>		\n			<h3 >\n			Social media empowers local businesses to thrive by fostering genuine connections.	</h3>		\n		<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n					Community			</h2>\n			<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n			Community engagement is the heart and soul of local businesses, weaving vibrant connections &amp; fostering trust.	</h3>		\n			<h3 >\n		Ways your business can stand out in your community:	</h3>\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n										Directories & Listings\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Local Publications\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Partnerships\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Host Events\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		<p>Community engagement is the cornerstone of a thriving local business, encompassing a range of strategies aimed at fostering genuine connections and building a strong presence within the community. It begins with ensuring that your business is easily discoverable by listing it on relevant directories and platforms tailored to your niche, providing potential customers with easy access to essential information.</p><p>Sharing compelling stories and graphics about your business in local publications and online platforms not only increases visibility but also humanizes your brand, resonating with audiences on a personal level. </p>		\n			<h3 >\n		Community engagement<br /> is at the core of local business success.<br />	</h3>\n		<p>Hosting engaging events offers an opportunity to reward existing customers while attracting new ones, creating memorable experiences that leave a lasting impression. By leveraging digital ads alongside these community-focused efforts, businesses can amplify their visibility, ensuring that they remain top-of-mind within their local community.</p>		\n			<h3 >\n			Partnering with nearby businesses and joining community events<br> fosters growth and collaboration.	</h3>		\n		<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n					Digital			</h2>\n			<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">\n			Effective digital ads rely on strategic targeting, &amp; impactful brand showcases.	</h3>		\n			<h3 >\n		Which  Ad Platform<br /> is best for your business?	</h3>\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n										Meta (Facebook & Instagram)\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Google\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										LinkedIn\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										TikTok\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		<p>In the digital landscape, success in advertising hinges on several key strategies. Firstly, identifying the most effective platforms tailored to your target audience and messaging is paramount. Secondly, crafting captivating walk-through videos that showcase your business, team, and offerings is essential for engaging potential customers. Thirdly, launching \"always-on\" ad campaigns specifically targeted to local audiences, complemented by incentives or discounts, drives engagement and conversion.</p>		\n			<h3 >\n		Ad Campaign Best-Practices:	</h3>\n					<h5 id=\"elementor-tab-title-2301\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2301\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n												<a href=\"/\">\'Always On\' Video Ad</a>\n					</h5>\n					<p>Create an engaging and clear video that showcases your business, your team, your offerings and your culture. </p>\n					<h5 id=\"elementor-tab-title-2302\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2302\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n												<a href=\"/\">Audience Targeting</a>\n					</h5>\n					<p>Start with a local audience that is within an appropriate distance from your shop. If you have a contact list of more than 1000, creating a Lookalike audience is also a good option. </p>\n					<h5 id=\"elementor-tab-title-2303\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2303\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n												<a href=\"/\">Incentive  Ads</a>\n					</h5>\n					<p>Once a person views your video, and thus expresses a small amount of interest, it&#8217;s important to follow-up with them. Set up another ad to all your viewers that further informs and nudges them to become a customer. Having a high value incentive or offer is a great option to get new clients in the door. </p>\n			<h4 >\n		Video Ads are still the most cost effective form of digital advertising!	</h4>\n			<h3 >\n			Integrating local engagement, social media presence, community involvement, and strategic digital advertising creates a powerful framework for small businesses to amplify their voice and thrive both online and within their community!	</h3>		\n			<h3>Want to learn more about these strategies? Contact Us!</h3>\n		<a href=\"https://go.kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/book-with-me-page\" target=\"_self\" data-hover-color=\"#000000\" data-hover-background-color=\"#FFFFFF\" data-hover-border-color=\"#000000\" style=\"padding: 20\" rel=\"noopener\">	Book a Call</a>','Stay relevant both online, and in your community!','','draft','closed','closed','','small-biz-guide','','','2026-02-24 22:21:06','2026-02-24 22:21:06','',0,'https://kijacreative.com/?page_id=5568',0,'page','',0),(5633,1,'2024-05-15 00:02:25','2024-05-15 00:02:25','','S7304822','','inherit','open','closed','','s7304822','','','2024-05-15 00:02:25','2024-05-15 00:02:25','',5550,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/S7304822.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(5637,1,'2024-05-15 13:44:44','2024-05-15 13:44:44','','gbl-ocp','','inherit','open','closed','','gbl-ocp','','','2024-05-15 13:44:44','2024-05-15 13:44:44','',5550,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/gbl-ocp.png',0,'attachm