"alwaysActivated\"\n  data-activation-value=\"\"\n  data-deactivation-type=\"neverDeactivate\"\n  data-deactivation-value=\"\"\n  data-form-name=\"Contact Us - Landing Page\"\n  data-height=\"824\"\n  data-layout-iframe-id=\"inline-5FiKjczoXOF44atRGSmS\"\n  data-form-id=\"5FiKjczoXOF44atRGSmS\"\n  title=\"Contact Us - Landing Page\"\n      >\n</iframe>\n			<h2 >\n			Comprehensive Digital Marketing Solutions	</h2>		\n		<p>Each of our core packages can be further customized to meet your unique needs.</p><p>No set-up fees. 6 month commitment required. </p>		\n		<h4>\n		Local Visibility Enhancer	</h4>\n		LOCAL	\n							$\n						1000\n					Monthly \n			<ul>\n					<li>\n								Google Business Profile Management: Ensure your business appears prominently in local search results.\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Reputation Management: Integrate feedback mechanisms to accumulate and manage positive reviews to build trust and authority.\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Link Building: Get listed in key online directories to increase visibility.\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Contact-List Email Campaign: Stay top-of-mind with your current customers to keep them coming back and referring new ones.\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								1 Scheduled Professional Content Day per term: Receive 30+ pictures for social content\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Social Content Coaching with Your Team: Including Branded Graphic Social Templates\n			</li>\n			</ul>\n		<a href=\"http://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/small-biz-guide/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\">	Learn More													</a>	\n		<h4>\n		Growth Accelerator	</h4>\n		SOCIAL	\n							$\n						1500\n					Monthly, Plus Ad Spend\n			<ul>\n					<li>\n								All features of Local Visibility Boost\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Company Promo Video for Digital Advertising\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Custom Landing Page Designed for Lead-Capture\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								1 Digital Ad Campaign (Google, Meta or LinkedIN)\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Audience Targeting\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Automated Lead Follow-up- email/text\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Monthly Ad Campaign Management &amp; Analytics\n			</li>\n			</ul>\n		<a href=\"https://go.kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/book-with-me-page\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\">	Learn More													</a>	\n		<h4>\n		Community Champion	</h4>\n		COMMUNITY	\n							$\n						2000\n					Monthly, Plus Ad Spend\n			<ul>\n					<li>\n								All features of Growth Accelerator\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								2nd Digital Ad Campaign: Includes Multiple Landing Pages and a Robust Lead Follow-Up Emails/Texts\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Co-plan &amp; Promote 1 Local Event every 3 months: Help Source Local Partners for Event, Create Graphics for Event and Promote in Targeted Digital Ad Campaign \n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Professional photography  and  video of event for use in ongoing marketing efforts.\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Scheduled Professional Content Day every 3 months: Includes 30+ pictures for Social Media \n			</li>\n			</ul>\n		<a href=\"https://go.kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/book-with-me-page\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\">	Learn More													</a>	\n		<h4>\n		ALa Carte Options	</h4>\n		DIGITAL	\n			<ul>\n					<li>\n								Local Event Package\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Professional Photography Package\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Custom Website Development\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Social Boost Package\n			</li>\n			</ul>\n		<a href=\"https://go.kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/book-with-me-page\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\">	Learn More													</a>	\n		<p>Ask about our other pricing options.</p>		\n			<h2 >\n			Integrated Digital Marketing Package	</h2>		\n		<p>Unlock the full potential of your business with our Integrated Digital Marketing Powerhouse Package. Designed for maximum impact, this all-inclusive package combines the essential pillars of digital marketing into one comprehensive strategy. From enhancing your local SEO to dynamic social media campaigns, community engagement, and optimized digital advertising, we provide everything you need to establish a dominant online presence and drive substantial business growth.</p>		\n							$\n						8500\n					Total\n			<ul>\n					<li>\n								Enhanced Local Online Visibility\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Social Media and Email Marketing Strategy\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Community Engagement\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Digital Advertising\n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Quick Set Up &amp; Start \n			</li>\n					<li>\n								Includes 3 Months Managment\n			</li>\n			</ul>\n		<a href=\"https://go.kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/book-with-me-page\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\">	Learn More													</a>	\n			<h3 >\n			What our clients say	</h3>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.9.1 - 14-12-2022 */\n.elementor-testimonial-wrapper{overflow:hidden;text-align:center}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-content{font-size:1.3em;margin-bottom:20px}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-name{line-height:1.5;display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-job{font-size:.85em;display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta{width:100%;line-height:1}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta-inner{display:inline-block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-details,.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-image{display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta .elementor-testimonial-image img{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;-o-object-fit:cover;object-fit:cover;max-width:none}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-aside .elementor-testimonial-image{padding-right:15px}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-aside .elementor-testimonial-details{text-align:left}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-details,.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-image{display:block}.elementor-testimonial-wrapper .elementor-testimonial-meta.elementor-testimonial-image-position-top .elementor-testimonial-image{margin-bottom:20px}</style>		\n\"Partnering with Kija Creative was the best decision we made this year! Their team doesn\'t just understand digital marketing; they breathe life into it with a mix of creativity and precision that\'s hard to come by Our community presence has never been stronger, and it\'s all thanks to the magic touch of Kija Creative!\"\n							<a href=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/ocp-case-study/\"><img width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/amanda.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>						\n														<a href=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/ocp-case-study/\">Amanda</a>\n																						<a href=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/ocp-case-study/\">Owner at Oak Cliff Pilates</a>\n	<img width=\"949\" height=\"610\" src=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph.jpg 949w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph-300x193.jpg 300w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph-768x494.jpg 768w, https://kijacreativstg.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kiel-steph-600x386.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 949px) 100vw, 949px\" />		<a itemprop=\"url\" style=\"font-size: 80px\" href=\"https://vimeo.com/938393069\" data-type=\"iframe\">\n	</a>\n			<h2 >\n			Who We Are	</h2>		\n		<p>We specialize in combining community engagement and digital marketing. We teach best practices for online success, create digital assets, teach social media strategy &amp; co-plan local events, all to help amplify your voice in the community and online. We are purposely a boutique agency in order to focus on personalized service and ensure your business gets the attention it deserves. </p>','Kija Services','','draft','closed','closed','','services','','','2026-02-24 22:21:06','2026-02-24 22:21:06','',0,'https://kijacreative.com/?page_id=5645',0,'page','',0),(5696,1,'2026-02-24 22:06:38','2026-02-24 22:06:38','','Our Services','','publish','closed','closed','','our-services','','','2026-02-24 22:06:38','2026-02-24 22:06:38','',0,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/our-services/',2,'nav_menu_item','',0),(5702,1,'2024-05-15 20:55:27','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Who is Kija Creative','','draft','closed','open','','','','','2024-05-15 20:55:27','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://kijacreative.com/?p=5702',0,'post','',0),(5723,1,'2026-02-24 22:06:49','2026-02-24 22:06:49',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','5723','','','2026-02-24 22:06:49','2026-02-24 22:06:49','',0,'https://kijacreative.wpenginepowered.com/5723/',3,'nav_menu_item','',0),(5740,2,'2026-02-25 15:35:02','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','AI Guidance 2026','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2026-02-25 15:35:02','2026-02-25 15:35:02','',0,'https://kijacreative.com/?page_id=5740',0,'page','',0),(5745,2,'2026-03-05 20:50:13','2026-03-05 20:50:13','','Honeycomb.be','','publish','closed','closed','','honeycomb-be','','','2026-03-05 21:51:24','2026-03-05 21:51:24','',0,'https://kijacreative.com/?post_type=portfolio&#038;p=5745',0,'portfolio','',0),(5746,2,'2026-03-05 19:41:12','2026-03-05 19:41:12','','HoneyComb.BE','','inherit','open','closed','','honeycomb-be','','','2026-03-05 19:41:12','2026-03-05 19:41:12','',5745,'